WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:17.352
When the grown-ups came back, the twins told them everything.

2
00:00:17.372 --> 00:00:24.276
"It was really bright," said Jordan, covering his eyes with his little hands.

3
00:00:26.237 --> 00:00:28.218
Vinnie and Mandy held their breath.

4
00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:31.680
Then Dad smiled at the twins.

5
00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.492
"What an imagination!"

6
00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:35.793
he laughed.

7
00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.094
Jordan looked at Vinnie and Mandy.

8
00:00:39.114 --> 00:00:41.894
"Tell them about your book!"

9
00:00:42.455 --> 00:00:43.135
he cried.

10
00:00:43.155 --> 00:00:48.356
"Come on, kids," interrupted Aunt Leah.

11
00:00:48.376 --> 00:00:50.877
"It's nap time."

12
00:00:51.377 --> 00:00:52.657
She led them upstairs.

13
00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:55.978
"What about a game of catch?"

14
00:00:56.538 --> 00:00:57.779
asked Uncle Wilson.

15
00:00:57.799 --> 00:01:02.800
"Okay! Let me get my mitt," answered Vinnie.

16
00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:05.770
Mandy followed her brother.

17
00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:09.773
"Whew! That was close!"

18
00:01:10.453 --> 00:01:11.034
she said.

19
00:01:11.054 --> 00:01:17.279
"We have to be more careful," agreed Vinnie, looking for his baseball mitt.

20
00:01:17.299 --> 00:01:19.641
"Do you want to play?"

21
00:01:19.661 --> 00:01:24.485
"No, I'm going to read," said Mandy.

22
00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:27.848
Vinnie stared at his sister.

23
00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:32.412
"Are you planning to go on a photo trip without me?"

24
00:01:32.948 --> 00:01:34.409
he said suspiciously.

25
00:01:34.429 --> 00:01:38.991
"You tried to go without me—three times!"

26
00:01:39.651 --> 00:01:40.571
she yelled back.

27
00:01:40.591 --> 00:01:43.092
"Only twice!"

28
00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:45.093
Vinnie shouted at her.

29
00:01:46.914 --> 00:01:48.735
Mandy ran up to the attic.

30
00:01:50.355 --> 00:01:53.537
"No!" yelled Vinnie as he ran after her.

31
00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:59.139
When Vinnie got to the attic he saw Mandy with the photo album.

32
00:02:00.259 --> 00:02:01.180
Vinnie grabbed it.

33
00:02:02.928 --> 00:02:03.908
"Let go!"

34
00:02:04.509 --> 00:02:06.650
cried Mandy, still holding on.

35
00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:10.511
The children pulled the album back and forth.

36
00:02:11.832 --> 00:02:12.932
Then Vinnie let go.

37
00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:16.994
Mandy fell to the floor and dropped the album.

38
00:02:18.314 --> 00:02:20.335
It lay open to another page.

39
00:02:20.355 --> 00:02:26.057
"Hey, this photo is different," said Mandy.

40
00:02:27.478 --> 00:02:28.838
She picked up the photo.

41
00:02:30.199 --> 00:02:32.340
The picture showed a sandy wilderness.

42
00:02:33.468 --> 00:02:35.129
The sun looked very hot.

43
00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.792
The old man was in front of a cave.

44
00:02:39.812 --> 00:02:42.794
Just inside the cave was a glowing object.

45
00:02:42.814 --> 00:02:46.917
"I wonder what's inside the cave?"

46
00:02:47.558 --> 00:02:48.418
Vinnie asked.

47
00:02:49.659 --> 00:02:51.240
The photo glowed brighter.

48
00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:56.063
"Looks like we're going to find out," said Mandy.

49
00:02:58.705 --> 00:03:03.108
The children fell down the dark tunnel and landed on warm sand.

50
00:03:04.532 --> 00:03:06.573
They could feel the heat right away.

51
00:03:06.593 --> 00:03:12.334
"Oh, the sun is really hot," said Vinnie.

52
00:03:13.955 --> 00:03:15.815
He slowly opened his eyes.

53
00:03:15.835 --> 00:03:23.897
"We're in a sort of desert," she said, looking at the sandy ground.

54
00:03:25.358 --> 00:03:29.699
All around them were short trees and small grassy areas too.

55
00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.460
It was very quiet.

56
00:03:34.356 --> 00:03:35.696
"I'm not wearing much!"

57
00:03:36.377 --> 00:03:37.137
Vinnie cried.

58
00:03:38.257 --> 00:03:41.898
He was only wearing short pants made out of animal skin.

59
00:03:43.279 --> 00:03:47.400
Mandy was wearing a top and a skirt made out of soft leather.

60
00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.941
She rubbed her hand against her skirt.

61
00:03:50.961 --> 00:03:55.522
"It feels very soft," she said.

62
00:03:57.202 --> 00:04:00.223
Vinnie walked over to a tree and leaned against it.

63
00:04:00.243 --> 00:04:02.944
"Where do you think we are?"

64
00:04:04.524 --> 00:04:07.285
"I don't—" Mandy suddenly stopped.

65
00:04:08.625 --> 00:04:09.886
She covered her mouth.

66
00:04:11.446 --> 00:04:12.126
"What is it?"

67
00:04:12.747 --> 00:04:13.467
Vinnie asked.

68
00:04:15.207 --> 00:04:16.808
Mandy could not speak.

69
00:04:18.108 --> 00:04:20.589
She lifted a shaking finger at Vinnie.

70
00:04:21.849 --> 00:04:23.950
He heard a low growling noise.

71
00:04:26.351 --> 00:04:28.271
Vinnie slowly turned his head.

72
00:04:31.412 --> 00:04:35.316
"Argh!" he screamed as two growling hyenas ran toward him.
